// The phase colossus (GDR-0027: "boss: giant phase ships"; GDR-0127, Niklas 20 Oct 2026: a giant phase ship whose
// sections each have a blink drive, each on cores of their own like the Keeper's pods and the Spire's sections, so once
// shot apart the pieces blink about on their own). Four sections, each with a phase core and a blink drive: a head with
// three lances, two wings with a lance and a thruster each, and a hub with two cores and two thrusters, joined by one
// bridge block each (the head's at (5, 3) below its plate, the wings' at (3, 5) and (7, 5) beside the hub's drive row).
// Whole, it weighs more than three drives carry, so a blink takes all four; shot apart, every section carries itself.
// PLACEHOLDER layout (lead default, 20 Oct 2026; docs/results/walkers-balance-2026-10-20.md).
